.TH UNHEADED\-BASELINE 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded 158367ea" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
unheaded\-baseline \- Evaluate this host against the shipped baseline and report every deviation (ADR\-098).
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B unheaded\-baseline
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Evaluate this host against the shipped baseline and report every deviation (ADR\-098).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-baseline \fISTRING\fR
baseline file (root\-owned) (default /usr/share/unheaded/baseline/baseline.yaml)
.TP
.B \-\-config \fISTRING\fR
mode file: mode=audit|enforcing (default /etc/unheaded/baseline.conf)
.TP
.B \-\-hostname \fISTRING\fR
host name in the baseline (default: os.Hostname)
.TP
.B \-\-proc\-sys \fISTRING\fR
sysctl tree to read (default /proc/sys; tests)
.TP
.B \-\-pubkey \fISTRING\fR
ML\-DSA\-65 public key that must have sealed the snapshot (default /etc/unheaded/compliance/snapshot.pub)
.TP
.B \-\-remediate\-state \fISTRING\fR
the remediation executor's backups and journal (enforcing) (default /var/lib/unheaded/remediate)
.TP
.B \-\-root\-facts \fISTRING\fR
directory holding aa\-status.json and root\-path, written as root before the agent runs
.TP
.B \-\-snapshot \fISTRING\fR
sealed snapshot of this host's fixes (maps deviations to fixes; enforcing needs it) (default /etc/unheaded/compliance/snapshot.json)
.TP
.B \-\-state\-dir \fISTRING\fR
where report.json is written (default /var/lib/unheaded/baseline)
.TP
.B \-\-textfile\-dir \fISTRING\fR
node\-exporter textfile directory (optional)
.TP
.B \-\-timeout \fIDURATION\fR
give up after this long (default 2m0s)
.TP
.B \-\-trusted\-uid \fIN\fR
uid that must own the baseline and the snapshot (root; tests)
.TP
.B \-\-wotan\-addr \fISTRING\fR
Wotan HTTP host:port; when set, deviations are published on compliance.deviation.<host> (default: $WOTAN_ADDR, empty = off)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
unheaded\-baseline
unheaded\-baseline \-\-baseline /etc/unheaded/baseline.yaml \-\-snapshot
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
